.TH SDL_CancelGPUCommandBuffer 3 "SDL 3.5.0" "Simple Directmedia Layer" "SDL3 FUNCTIONS"
.SH NAME
SDL_CancelGPUCommandBuffer \- Cancels a command buffer.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <SDL3/SDL_gpu.h>
.PP
.BI "bool SDL_CancelGPUCommandBuffer(
.BI "    SDL_GPUCommandBuffer *command_buffer);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
None of the enqueued commands are executed\[char46]
.PP
It is an error to call this function after a swapchain texture has been acquired\[char46]
.PP
This must be called from the thread the command buffer was acquired on\[char46]
.PP
You must not reference the command buffer after calling this function\[char46]

.SH FUNCTION PARAMETERS
.TP
.I command_buffer
a command buffer\[char46]
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns true on success, false on error; call
.BR SDL_GetError ()
for more information\[char46]

.SH AVAILABILITY
This function is available since SDL 3\[char46]2\[char46]0\[char46]

